<title>SPAIN: Spain's Acesa raises Aucat stake to 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Acesa raises Aucat stake to 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish toll motorway operator Autopistas CESA-Acesa said on Friday it had raised its stake in Aucat to 45 percent as part of a strategy of gradually increasing ownership of the toll motorway operator.</p>
<p>Acesa had a 27 percent stake before adding 17 percent or 160,753 shares.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
